WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Every Mixer track goes to the Master. Routing sends it somewhere else too.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.400
Select the track to send, here the Chords.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.600
Click the arrow under another track: the Chords now go there as well.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.400
The knob under it is the send level: how much goes there.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.200
Put a reverb on that track: a reverb bus that every track can share.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:38.200
Right-click an arrow for more: Route to this track only, or Sidechain to this track.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:45.000
Play: the chords get their space, and every track keeps its own fader.
